{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL1Bha2FyYW0lMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Pakaram","description":"Tapu, young boy of 10-11 years is born with a knack for seeing, believing and perceiving things unlike many and has the potential to depict them through his creativity. When lost in his own world, he is often oblivious to what the present demands from him.  Raja, his close friend shares Tapu's interests but not with the same intensity. Raja's father disapproves of Raja and Tapu's friendship and decides to send his son to a town school for better education. Shantu, a so called mentally challenged person, gradually starts to share a special bond with Tapu after Raja leaves.  Raja, on the other hand, feels crippled and isolated in his new surrounding and his growing impatience forces his father to bring him back home. As fate would have it, their friendship soars high and gets set to touch a new horizon.\n\nReleased 1 Aug 2015 · BD · Language: Bengali · 124 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Bengali","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Drama","Bengali"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/je3qQTUZPsSsj9fVqrN6EyATOGa.jpg","imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"124 min","cast":["Soham Moitra","Ritesh Biswas","Lama Halder"],"director":["Sankar Debnath"],"released":"2015-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Sankar Debnath","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pba1XutC8uFgaqLaT0R9o2hLlzb.jpg"},{"name":"Soham Moitra"},{"name":"Ritesh Biswas"},{"name":"Lama Halder","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/23O53MFw6UrdPVbFWq1jeHy35Fv.jpg"}]},"country":"BD","language":"Bengali","links":[{"name":"Soham Moitra","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Soham%20Moitra"},{"name":"Ritesh Biswas","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ritesh%20Biswas"},{"name":"Lama Halder","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lama%20Halder"},{"name":"Sankar De